# .godotignore.template — copy to .godotignore inside any directory
# that Godot should not scan/import.
#
# Per spec 04 GODOT_ROOT_ALLOWLIST: pipeline scratch, candidate
# directories, model weights, etc. must NOT live inside the Godot
# project root (engine/ or demo/). They go in pipeline/ or tools/.
#
# This template is for when small dirs INSIDE engine/ or demo/ should
# be hidden from Godot's import scan (e.g. an internal _scratch/ dir
# used during a single sprint). Drop a copy as `.godotignore` in any
# such dir.
#
# (Don't ship .godotignore in directories that ARE supposed to be
# imported; this template is just a starting point.)
